+
+Part of lf-studio (Apache-2.0); not part of the upstream Sol-H3-RTX5090 package.
+
+Tiny fake models stand in for H3: the layout and carving, the file format (write, read, SHA-256, identity and
+layout refusal, atomic replace, pruning), the lookup/FP8 structure a restore rebuilds, and one save -> restore round
+trip through the worker's Controller compared tensor by tensor. tests/check_stage1_snapshot_gpu.py checks the real
+model on the GPU.
+"""
+import hashlib
